---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout';
import { siteConfig } from '@/data/site';
---
<PageLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Ms V Lab Terms of Service - rules and guidelines for using our website." noIndex={true}>
  <article class="prose-custom lg:prose-lg xl:prose-xl max-w-none">
    <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 mb-8">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
    <p>By accessing <a href={siteConfig.url}>{siteConfig.url}</a>, you agree to these Terms. If you disagree, do not use the site.</p>

    <h2>2. Content License</h2>
    <p>All content (articles, images, reviews, code) is © {siteConfig.name} or its licensors. You may:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Read, share, link to our content</li>
      <li>Quote short excerpts (≤100 words) with attribution + link</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You may NOT: republish full articles, scrape content, use commercially without permission.</p>

    <h2>3. Reviews & Recommendations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reviews reflect our honest opinion at time of publication</li>
      <li>Product specs, prices, availability change — verify before buying</li>
      <li>We're not liable for purchase decisions based on our content</li>
      <li>"Best" = our top pick for most people; your needs may differ</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>We earn commissions on some links (<a href="/affiliate-disclosure">full disclosure</a>). This doesn't affect your price or our editorial independence.</p>

    <h2>5. User Conduct</h2>
    <p>Don't: scrape, hack, spam, inject code, violate laws, impersonate others, or disrupt the site.</p>

    <h2>6. Disclaimers</h2>
    <p><strong>Content is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.</strong> We strive for accuracy but don't guarantee completeness, timeliness, or fitness for a particular purpose. Product info may be outdated.</p>

    <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, {siteConfig.name} is not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or loss of profits/data, arising from your use of the site or reliance on our content.</p>

    <h2>8. Indemnification</h2>
    <p>You agree to defend and hold {siteConfig.name} harmless from claims arising from your use of the site or violation of these Terms.</p>

    <h2>9. Governing Law</h2>
    <p>These Terms governed by the laws of the jurisdiction where {siteConfig.name} operates, without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>

    <h2>10. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms. Continued use after changes = acceptance. Check this page periodically.</p>

    <h2>11. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{siteConfig.author.email}">{siteConfig.author.email}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
